    {
      "title": "Eagles' Peak",
      "text": "Head to Eagles' Peak west of the Tree Gnome Stronghold.<ul><li>If Eagles' Peak lodestone is activated, teleport to it and run northwest.</li><li>Alternatively, teleport to the Memorial of Guthix using memory stands in the currency pouch and run southeast.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Go to the northern side of the mountain's base to a campsite.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Inspect the books for a Bird book.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Read the book to obtain a Metal feather.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Climb the rocks attached to the mountain next to the campsite (25 Agility needed).",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the metal feather on the rocky outcrop.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Enter the cave, then head south until a cutscene with Nickolaus plays.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Shout-to Nickolaus.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "The Ardougne zookeeper sent me to find you."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "So it's not that you're trapped then?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Could I help at all?"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Pick up 10 eagle feathers in the dungeon (called 'giant feathers' on the floor).",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "The disguise",
      "text": "Head to the south-east corner of Varrock to the Fancy Clothes Store.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to the Fancy-Dress shop owner.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Well, specifically I'm after a couple of bird costumes."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Have the owner make you two eagle capes and two fake beaks.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I've got the feathers and the materials you requested."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Okay, here are the materials. Eagle me up."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Equip your disguise (eagle cape and fake beak) and go back to the Eagle's Peak cave and shout to Nickolaus.",
